sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Funder as Funder.sol<br/>(Sepolia)
    participant FunderRC as ReactiveFunderRC<br/>(Lasna)
    participant Callback as Callback Proxy<br/>(Sepolia)
    participant Faucet as Reactive Faucet<br/>(Lasna)
    participant RSC as YieldOptimizerRsc<br/>(Lasna)

    Note over User,RSC: REACTIVATE: Self-Sustaining Gas Pattern

    User->>Funder: Send ETH (fees)
    Funder-->>FunderRC: emit FundsReceived(user, amount)
    
    FunderRC->>FunderRC: Evaluate: amount >= MIN_BRIDGE?
    
    alt Amount >= 0.001 ETH
        FunderRC->>FunderRC: Calculate bridgeAmount (95%)
        FunderRC->>Callback: emit Callback(coverDebt)
        Callback->>Funder: coverDebt(rscAddress)
        Funder->>Callback: depositTo(rscAddress)
        Callback->>RSC: Receive REACT tokens
        Note over RSC: Balance replenished
    end
    
    FunderRC->>FunderRC: Check RSC balance
    
    alt RSC balance < threshold
        FunderRC->>Callback: emit Callback(bridgeToFaucet)
        Callback->>Funder: bridgeToFaucet(rsc, amount)
        Funder->>Faucet: Convert SepETH to REACT
        Faucet-->>RSC: 100 REACT per SepETH
        Note over RSC: Auto-refilled
    end

    Note over RSC: RSC continues<br/>autonomous operation
